From 6f204ae4ecd47f6a4a69243c69c4f736fc0ee57a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: canarit <gaqu1994@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:06:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] experiment(G1): generate an input record per endpoint

concord::api! now emits, for every endpoint, a #[non_exhaustive]
{Endpoint}Input with the endpoint's own values and body as public fields
and new(required..); the request type holds its parent handle plus that
input and gains input()/input_mut()/into_input(); the parent gains
{endpoint}_with(input). Navigation methods, setters, prepare/send, Debug
text, wire output and diagnostics are unchanged (all 683 workspace tests
and 162 UI cases pass unmodified). Field docs state starting state,
inherit/omit/replace meaning and the declaring owner of an inherited key.

New: crates/concord/tests/inputs.rs (I01-I08), ui/input_name_collisions.

Experiment branch only: see v4/dx-4.3/DECISIONS.md (G1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
